{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34759","headline":"浙东罢府西归酬别张广文皮先辈陆秀才 · 李縠","name":"浙东罢府西归酬别张广文皮先辈陆秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂有头风笔下痊，浪成蛮语向初筵。\n兰亭旧趾虽曾见，柯笛遗音更不传。\n照曜文星吴分野，留连花月晋名贤。\n相逢只恨相知晚，一曲骊歌又几年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李縠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}